   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "## Finding a Percentage of an Amount with a calculator"
  },
  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "We can also use a calculator to work out a percentage of an amount."
  },
  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "We can either use the percentage button or convert the percentage to a decimal or fraction first."
  },
  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "### Using the percentage button"
  },
  {
   "kind": "figure",
   "figure_ref": "assets/001-classwiz.png",
   "alt": "classwiz"
  },
  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "On the Classwiz calculator to get % press SHIFT then the ANS button:"
  },
  {
   "kind": "figure",
   "figure_ref": "assets/002-Calculator-buttons-shift.jpg",
   "alt": "Calculator buttons shift"
  },
