  },
  {
   "kind": "worked-example",
   "title": "Example 7: Work out 37% of 450",
   "steps": [
    {
     "heading": null,
     "body": "On the calculator we type 37% × 450:\n\n\n\nThis gives an answer of 333⁄2, we can press the SD button to get a decimal answer:\n\n\n\n333⁄2 = 166.5",
     "figure_refs": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "### Converting to a decimal or a fraction"
  },
  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "We can convert percentages to decimals or fractions."
  },
  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "To convert a percentage to a decimal we divide by 100"
  },
  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "54% = 0.54  \n7% = 0.07  \n84% = 0.84  \n59% = 0.59"
  },
