   "title": "Example 8: Work out 27% of 350",
   "steps": [
    {
     "heading": null,
     "body": "27 ÷ 100 = 0.27  \n27% = 0.27\n\nWe type 0.27 × 350 into the calculator:\n\n\n\nThis gives an answer of 189⁄2, we can press the SD button to get a decimal answer:\n\n\n\n189⁄2 = 94.5",
     "figure_refs": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "A percentage is the same as a fraction out of 100, we can We can convert percentages to fractions. by writing them over 100"
  },
  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "55% = 55⁄100  \n9% = 9⁄100  \n87% = 87⁄100  \n29% = 29⁄100  \n17.5% = 17.5⁄100"
  },
